notes=("Dissolved 'Other accordions' into Button accordion (melodeon, bayan, garmon, Cajun etc. as types/archetypes) and 'Other harmonicas' into Diatonic harmonica (tremolo, octave, chord as types/archetypes). Added Bandoneon. "
 "Old model 'Melodeon' became a type; old 'Anglo concertina'/'English concertina' became archetypes; McNeela Sparrow kept as a version. "
 "Left out: Wheatstone/Lachenal founding years, Morino and Club start years beyond 1936, Special 20 comb details, Jeffries/Crabb as brands, shruti box makers (no retrieved source names any). Paolo Soprani and Scandalli founding dates are disputed (1863/1864; 1900/1916); used museum/brand-history dates.")
